<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>인건비분석보고서_대전_금융1센터_2026-10</title><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><w:WordDocument><w:View>Print</w:View><w:Zoom>100</w:Zoom><w:DoNotOptimizeForBrowser/></w:WordDocument></xml><![endif]--><style>@page WordSection1{size:595.3pt 841.9pt;margin:54pt 50pt 54pt 50pt;mso-header-margin:28pt;mso-footer-margin:28pt;}div.WordSection1{page:WordSection1;}body{font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;color:#111827;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.6}
h1{font-size:18pt;margin:4pt 0}h2{font-size:13pt;border-bottom:1.5pt solid #1d4ed8;padding-bottom:3pt;margin:18pt 0 8pt}
.rp-kicker{color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt}.rp-meta{color:#6b7280;font-size:9pt}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:6pt 0}th,td{border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:4pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt}th{background:#f3f4f6;text-align:left}
.r{text-align:right}tr.sel td{background:#eef2ff;font-weight:bold}.rp-kpis{display:flex;gap:8pt}.rp-kpis div{border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:6pt 8pt;flex:1}
.rp-kpis span,.rp-kpis em{display:block;font-size:9pt;color:#6b7280;font-style:normal}.rp-kpis b{font-size:14pt}.rp-verdict{font-weight:bold}.rp-note{font-size:9pt;color:#6b7280} .rp-head{border-bottom:2pt solid #1d4ed8;padding-bottom:8pt;margin-bottom:6pt} h2{page-break-after:avoid} table{page-break-inside:avoid} td b{font-size:14pt} td span,td em{display:block;font-size:9pt;color:#6b7280;font-style:normal}</style></head><body><div class="WordSection1">
  <header class="rp-head">
    <div class="rp-kicker" style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">인건비 분석 보고서</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">대전 금융1센터 직접인건비 경쟁력 분석</h1>
    <div class="rp-meta" style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">센터유형 금융 · 기준 시점 2026-10 (급여테이블 2026-01 v1) · 작성일 2026-10-25</div>
  </header>
  <section><h2 style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;font-size:13pt;border-bottom:1.5pt solid #1d4ed8;padding-bottom:3pt;margin:18pt 0 8pt;">1. 요약</h2>
    <table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:6pt 0;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;"><tbody><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;"><span style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">상담사 시급</span><b style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">12,206원</b><em style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">유형 중위수 대비 -4.8%</em></td><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;"><span style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">권고 평균 인상률</span><b style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">+3.4%</b><em style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">유형 중위수·시장 중위수 중 높은 값 기준</em></td><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;"><span style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">연간 추가 직접인건비</span><b style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">12,919만원</b><em style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">인원 84명 · 법정부담률 18.5% 가정</em></td></tr></tbody></table>
    <p class="rp-verdict" style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">대전 금융1센터의 인건비 수준은 동일 유형 대비 소폭 낮아, 목표 기준에 맞춘 조정을 검토할 수준입니다.</p>
    <ul><li style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">관리자 시급 16,167원은 금융 유형 중위수(17,005원) 대비 -4.9%이며, 같은 유형 9곳 중 7위입니다.</li><li style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">상담사 시급 12,206원은 금융 유형 중위수(12,823원) 대비 -4.8%이며, 같은 유형 9곳 중 9위입니다.</li><li style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">상담사은 채용시장 중위수(11,974원, 표본 8건) 대비 +1.9%입니다.</li><li style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">신입상담사 시급 12,660원은 금융 유형 중위수(12,493원) 대비 +1.3%이며, 같은 유형 9곳 중 3위입니다.</li><li style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">신입상담사은 채용시장 중위수(11,017원, 표본 8건) 대비 +14.9%입니다.</li></ul>
  </section>
  <section><h2 style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;font-size:13pt;border-bottom:1.5pt solid #1d4ed8;padding-bottom:3pt;margin:18pt 0 8pt;">2. 현재 인건비 구조</h2>
    <table class="rp-table" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:6pt 0;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;"><thead><tr><th style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">직무</th><th style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">상담유형</th><th class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">기본급</th><th class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">수당 합</th><th class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">월 고정급</th><th class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">비교 월액(B등급)</th><th class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">시급 환산</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">상담 · 신입</td><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">신입상담사</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">2,346,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">260,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">2,606,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">2,646,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">12,660</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">상담 · 사원</td><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">상담사</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">2,221,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">260,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">2,481,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">2,521,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">12,062</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">상담 · 선임</td><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">상담사</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">2,281,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">260,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">2,541,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">2,581,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">12,349</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">팀장</td><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">관리자</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">2,829,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">510,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">3,339,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">3,379,000</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">16,167</td></tr></tbody></table>
  </section>
  <section><h2 style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;font-size:13pt;border-bottom:1.5pt solid #1d4ed8;padding-bottom:3pt;margin:18pt 0 8pt;">3. 동일 유형·채용시장 비교 (시급, 원)</h2>
    <div class="rp-chart" style="font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;"><img src="data:image/png;base64," width="680" height="260" alt="비교 차트"></div>
