nt-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;">채용시장 중위수</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">+1.7%</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">995만원</td></tr><tr class="sel"><td style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;background:#eef2ff;font-weight:bold;">유형 중위수·시장 중위수 중 높은 값 (권고안)</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#eef2ff;font-weight:bold;">+3.4%</td><td class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#eef2ff;font-weight:bold;">12,919만원</td></tr></tbody></table>
    <table class="rp-table" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:6pt 0;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;"><thead><tr><th style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">상담유형 (권고안)</th><th class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">목표 시급</th><th class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">시급 인상액</th><th class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">인상률</th><th class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">인원</th><th class="r" style="border:1pt solid #d1d5db;padding:3pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',sans-serif;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;background:#f3f4f6;font-weight:bold;">연간 추가 비용</th></tr></thead>
